{"id":1590,"date":"2026-08-23T22:00:06","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:00:06","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1590"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:19:32","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:19:32","slug":"export-as-image","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/export-as-image\/","title":{"rendered":"Export as Image"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Export as Image<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1599\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportAsImage.webp\" alt=\"Export as Image\" width=\"82\" height=\"86\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportAsImage.webp 920w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportAsImage-287x300.webp 287w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportAsImage-768x804.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 82px) 100vw, 82px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">You can export any individual page as a high-quality image file directly from Open Publisher, with all UI elements automatically removed so the output is clean and production-ready.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Export as Image<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1597\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToImage.webp\" alt=\"How to Export as Image\" width=\"148\" height=\"69\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToImage.webp 392w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ExportToImage-300x140.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 148px) 100vw, 148px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Export &gt; Export as Image<\/strong>, or click <strong>Export Image<\/strong> in the Export ribbon group.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The engine captures a clean snapshot of the current page using <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">html2canvas<\/span>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Before taking the snapshot, all margin guides, selection boxes, and resize handles are stripped from a temporary clone of the page, ensuring no UI artefacts appear in the output.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All CSS filters &#8211; hue rotation, brightness adjustments, and more &#8211; are correctly applied to the exported image.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1593\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-225921.png\" alt=\"Image that has been Exported\" width=\"586\" height=\"401\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-225921.png 1444w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-225921-300x205.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-225921-1024x701.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-225921-768x525.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 586px) 100vw, 586px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Maximum Canvas Size<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1603\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2kPxMax.webp\" alt=\"Maximum Canvas Size\" width=\"127\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2kPxMax.webp 421w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2kPxMax-284x300.webp 284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">A maximum canvas dimension of <strong>2000px<\/strong> is enforced during image export to prevent browser out-of-memory crashes on very large or high-resolution documents. This ensures reliable export performance regardless of your document&#8217;s canvas size.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Export as Image You can export any individual page as a high-quality image file directly from Open Publisher, with all UI elements automatically removed so the output is clean and production-ready. How to Export as Image Go to File &gt; Export &gt; Export as Image, or click Export Image in the Export ribbon group. The [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1599,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1590","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1590","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1590"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1590\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1605,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1590\/revisions\/1605"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1599"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1590"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1590"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}